es、**1165 测试全过**。 (Files: app/services/weread_app_client.py, scripts/weread_app_login.py, app/services/wechat/_listen.py, app/services/wechat_monitor.py, app/services/cookie_store.py, tools/mitm_capture_weread.py, tests/test_weread_app.py, tests/test_wechat_monitor.py, doc/项目审查与优化方案-2026-10-05.md, CHANGELOG)
